		rdfs:label	"Aircraft Parts"@en ;
		skos:definition	"This industry subgroup includes companies that manufacture aircraft engines, aircraft engine parts, aircraft seats and seat frames, and aircraft sub-assemblies, such as wings, fuselage, airframes and tails."@en ;
