		rdfs:label	"Infrastructure Software"@en ;
		skos:definition	"This industry includes companies that develop infrastructure as well as middleware software and cloud and virtualization services. Infrastructure software controls the operation and management of computing infrastructure resources and includes operating systems, virtualization software, database management systems, data protection and recovery systems for enterprises, and enterprise software development tools. Middleware connects various software components or applications and includes Web servers, application servers and enterprise messaging systems."@en ;
		skos:notation	"181211" ;
		tempo:validFrom	"2014-08-08"^^xsd:date ;
		tempo:validTill	"2020-10-03"^^xsd:date ;
